  "claim": "Donald Wayne Johnson was the actor who starred in \"Word of Honor\" and \"Miami Vice\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Word of Honor (2003 film). Sentence: Word of Honor is an American television film released in 2003.\nPage: Word of Honor (2003 film). Sentence: It stars Don Johnson, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Sharon Lawrence, John Heard and Arliss Howard.\nPage: Don Johnson. Sentence: Donald Wayne Johnson (born December 15, 1949) is an American actor, producer, director, singer, and songwriter.\nPage: Don Johnson. Sentence: He played the role of James \"Sonny\" Crockett in the 1980s television series \"Miami Vice\" and had the eponymous lead role in the 1990s cop series \"Nash Bridges\".\nPage: Don Johnson. Sentence: Johnson is a Golden Globe–winning actor for his role in \"Miami Vice\", the American Power Boat Association's 1988 World Champion of the Offshore World Cup, and has received a star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame.",
